    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sell digital products for crypto with an n8n form\n\n### How it works\nA customer picks a product in the form and is sent to a CigalPay payment page, priced in USD or EUR. They pay in BTC, ETH, USDT or another coin. When CigalPay confirms the payment, the second part finds the order, checks it was paid in full for the checkout this workflow created, emails the download link once and marks the order as delivered. Anything that doesn't match is sent to you instead of being delivered.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-cigalpay** (Settings \u2192 Community Nodes, tested with 1.1.0). Unverified community nodes need self-hosted n8n.\n2. Create a CigalPay account and a **CigalPay API** credential: Account ID, API key and notification signing secret (dashboard \u2192 Settings \u2192 API credentials).\n3. Create a Data Table **cigalpay_orders** with the columns orderId, email, product, currency, checkoutId, downloadUrl, status (text) and price (number).\n4. Add an SMTP credential to both email nodes.\n5. Edit **Set your products and URLs** and **Set your shop emails**. The product names must match the form's dropdown.\n6. Activate the workflow, copy the **CigalPay Trigger** production URL into notificationUrl, then save.\n\n### Customization\nSend the order to your CRM, or deliver a licence key instead of a link.\n",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "e504ddd5-fe46-5898-be8b-87e45e8d161e",
      "name": "Sticky Note main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Take the order\nThe form creates a CigalPay checkout for the chosen product, saves the order as pending, and sends the customer to the payment page.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 1300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "9a848f44-cf88-5368-898f-d2b25898c162",
      "name": "Sticky Note order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deliver once paid\nOnly orders still pending are delivered, so the CONFIRMED and FINISHED notifications send one email. The checkout ID, currency and amount must match what was created.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1580,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e40d90db-de41-507c-be55-a3e40cbdd8ea",
      "name": "Sticky Note deliver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        260
      ]
    }
